{"id": "EUVD-2026-105359", "enisaUuid": "c2f5de38-d1e1-37dc-8037-c29731f81f59", "description": "When `CURLOPT_INTERFACE` (or the command line tool's `--interface` option) is\nset with one of the documented prefixes (`if!`, `host!`, `ifhost!`), that\nbinding is not part of the connection reuse key, so a later transfer asking\nfor a different source can silently reuse an existing connection and go out\nfrom the earlier transfer's source address", "datePublished": "2026-10-20T20:29:28", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T20:29:28", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2026-107929.json", "https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2026-107929.html", "https://hackerone.com/reports/4099618"], "aliases": ["GHSA-9644-8jhv-gxgm", "CVE-2026-107929"], "assigner": "curl", "epss": 0.29, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "00b14395-9827-3881-b09d-0eaa75bef7cc", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.11.1 \u22648.11.1"}, {"id": "01e2853b-30ff-3c6e-ac8a-a2f10f18c285", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.20.0 \u22648.20.0"}, {"id": "0b981558-fdc4-32c8-94b0-12ce84cb42ee", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.15.0 \u22648.15.0"}, {"id": "161cd1ce-ac7f-3c10-834f-eb3aa61e262b", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.16.0 \u22648.16.0"}, {"id": "2819f1bf-40de-33db-b7e9-f59662c1395f", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.22.0 \u22648.22.0"}, {"id": "3f53a4f8-c7f4-3d6a-acfb-9705940f0cc3", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.17.0 \u22648.17.0"}, {"id": "49611c2e-1eb0-3055-a2b0-a86e6d70cb0f", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.9.0 \u22648.9.0"}, {"id": "500c3032-3f79-3e30-a9c7-68ebade07427", "product": {"name": "curl", "vendor": {"name": "curl"}}, "product_version": "8.10.1 \u22648.10.1"}, {"id": "87c77be2-3e6c-3bb1